it information to plan a permanent-exhibits visit, then allow time for the adjacent Hermann Park destinations.","short_summary":"A science museum directly on Hermann Park Drive.","evidence_claim":"HMNS identifies its Hermann Park museum location as 5555 Hermann Park Drive and states that a Permanent Exhibit ticket covers more than a dozen exhibits.","source_url":"https://www.hmns.org/visit/faq/","source_title":"Houston Museum of Natural Science FAQ","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"5555 Hermann Park Drive; the cited FAQ lists general admission for permanent exhibits, with special-exhibit pricing varying.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rice-hermann-houston-zoo","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Houston Zoo","title":"Houston Zoo: Animal and Ecosystem Learning","subtitle":"Hermann Park Drive corridor","notes":"Reserve or purchase admission through the zoo’s official visit channels, and build in time to explore its animal and ecosystem interpretation.","short_summary":"A nonprofit zoo within Hermann Park focused on animals and ecosystems.","evidence_claim":"Hermann Park Conservancy identifies the Houston Zoo as a private nonprofit organization where guests learn about animals and the ecosystems they live in.","source_url":"https://hermannpark.org/visit/points-of-interest/","source_title":"Points of Interest — Hermann Park Conservancy","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The Conservancy directs visitors to the Houston Zoo for hours and information; verify current zoo admission and timed-entry requirements before visiting.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rice-hermann-lott-family-carousel","subject_type":"street_or_district","en